   "text": "\ud83c\udf82 DANNY DEVITO TURNS 82 \ud83c\udf82\nDanny DeVito was born on November 17, 1944 \u2014 82 years ago today \u2014 and his Penguin is one of the great comic-book villains.\nTo mark his 82nd birthday, we're spotlighting a fan edit from the collection: Batman Returns (1992) - The Smoother Sensical Cut - CK Cut - Fan Edit.\nBurton's dark Gotham Christmas, tightened up in the CK Cut.\nDM us for the link \u2014 THE WORLD'S LARGEST FAN EDIT COLLECTION.\n@DannyDeVito",
